{"summary":"Sling, bounce and swing your Kong to glory, watch out for traps and obstacles!","description":"Sling, bounce and swing your Kong to glory, but watch out for all manner of dastardly traps and obstacles. Go up until there’s no more up to go, or else meet your hilarious end!\n\nJoin Chimp, Pig, Jellyfish and over 140 other crazy and colorful characters as you challenge your friends to become the best Kong Slinger around.\n\nNow you can even take a selfie and create your very own Kong! Create Kongs of your friends and family and dress them up with fun accessories! There are thousands of combinations!\n\nSling Kong requires the following phone permissions:\nStorage - This will allow you to share images from the game.\nCamera and Record Audio - Allows you to take photos and record audio to customise your Kongs.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $19.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j6tpBy66AHo?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/86bBH6pOmM2igQYSWtB--e9hhBDgk8xR3ovHYtQuDkWEeQyFfSa-ocwfFG3UOOr2H6-Gtq2j4hhjQ0RNfY2Bqg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2CFQK5W6N_ln0SDFQd0-wH8DPhh3BZAt5vgv9t0-4ZnnavelranvJRibblTF89Sxn9tl9b7_xgYUGkiO19WfgS0","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WYbSIZM_z3hDybepS2rMTX3p-QO81cNlyd2MJXLA1y3lVgRUJW20AVAbZN7MxkuMWcdYDektODr2auKy6IJP5w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Jdo3L5tyN6by9iF8Q1gmDONlKJEdaj69dh2R1GvLHiL_eBsh1HFJ1CHUQoydpIa1J9fmmuS576eBFtE4ApsG8Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SXc3nSiMTmKtA1oqD-388M5l3-Kbwk36AAbEoEKcbzZ1UR5zttrKqRTUK9SMzzH9kUqguAh1ZQbQ7mteBFflZw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KNCwLoR3QoCU8U1UlQHQIyen_FBjSgWd8etlbAU0KAXL3A-LRLseO9lxSDxVk6IYDVgyd9prsxloSRpupLZd","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CsLJPj12FuJfKFQpkRmckzOmzKTgCTqZ-yb6CY5jOISfHaUJsK1hFRYUrkwtkyLKat8b3HoyxcQthfrB_b66","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FuVZ4H7m28GWuDN8gzIaO4pXWVJJVJpW5uRMH5st5G7XUDQhYeHT1vnLUYkF